[{"text": "I now give the floor", "start": 0.64, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "to her excellency", "start": 4.0, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "Ingred Jackson, chair of delegation", "start": 6.56, "duration": 7.88}, {"text": "of Granada.", "start": 11.12, "duration": 3.32}, {"text": "Mr. President,", "start": 32.0, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "distinguished heads of states and", "start": 34.0, "duration": 3.6}, {"text": "governments,", "start": 36.0, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "Mr. Secretary General, excellencies,", "start": 37.6, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "ladies and gentlemen,", "start": 41.28, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "let me thank the government and people", "start": 43.6, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "of Grenada for this privilege bestowed", "start": 45.44, "duration": 6.959}, {"text": "upon me and thank Grenada's visionary", "start": 48.0, "duration": 7.039}, {"text": "prime minister, honorable Deacon", "start": 52.399, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "Mitchell for the trust.", "start": 55.039, "duration": 4.561}, {"text": "Grenada congratulates you, Mr.", "start": 57.6, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "President, as president of the 81st", "start": 59.6, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "session of the general assembly. And we", "start": 61.84, "duration": 6.639}, {"text": "thank the former president Analikna", "start": 64.72, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "Burbuk.", "start": 68.479, "duration": 3.441}, {"text": "Mr. President,", "start": 70.0, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "one year ago, standing at this very", "start": 71.92, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "podium, the prime minister of Grenada", "start": 74.4, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "addressed this general assembly not only", "start": 77.2, "duration": 4.559}, {"text": "as our head of government, but as a", "start": 79.52, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "proud son of the Caribbean. He reminded", "start": 81.759, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "us that our region continues to", "start": 84.72, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "literally and figuratively weather", "start": 87.119, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "storms yet continues to rise with", "start": 89.36, "duration": 7.52}, {"text": "resilience, dignity, and hope. Today, as", "start": 92.64, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "I stand before you representing the", "start": 96.88, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "people of Grenada, I speak of", "start": 99.2, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "transformation", "start": 101.92, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "because resilience alone is no longer", "start": 103.68, "duration": 4.799}, {"text": "enough.", "start": 106.64, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "Our task cannot simply be to survive one", "start": 108.479, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "crisis after another. We must transform", "start": 111.68, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "the conditions that make people", "start": 115.119, "duration": 4.721}, {"text": "vulnerable in the first place. We must", "start": 116.96, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "renew our global systems, strengthen our", "start": 119.84, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "multilateral partnerships, and sermon", "start": 122.88, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "the collective will necessary to build a", "start": 125.6, "duration": 6.719}, {"text": "world worthy of the next generation.", "start": 128.8, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "And that transformation must begin with", "start": 132.319, "duration": 5.361}, {"text": "people.", "start": 135.76, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "Mr. President,", "start": 137.68, "duration": 4.559}, {"text": "Grenada joins CARACOM in calling for the", "start": 139.76, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "timely renewal of the mandate of the", "start": 142.239, "duration": 5.121}, {"text": "gang suppression force, its full and", "start": 144.4, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "rapid deployment in close partnership", "start": 147.36, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "with the Haitian National Police, and", "start": 149.68, "duration": 5.279}, {"text": "the provision of the personnel financing", "start": 152.319, "duration": 5.361}, {"text": "equipment and logistical support", "start": 154.959, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "necessary for it to fulfill its mandate", "start": 157.68, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "effectively with appropriate human", "start": 160.959, "duration": 4.401}, {"text": "rights safeguards.", "start": 163.44, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "These security efforts are essential to", "start": 165.36, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "creating the conditions for credible,", "start": 168.08, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "free, fair, and inclusive Haitianled", "start": 170.879, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "elections, the strengthening of national", "start": 173.599, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "institutions, and the restoration of", "start": 176.239, "duration": 5.841}, {"text": "constitutional governance.", "start": 178.959, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "Haiti is not a failed state. Haiti", "start": 182.08, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "represents a promise yet to be", "start": 185.599, "duration": 4.881}, {"text": "fulfilled. It is a promise to the", "start": 188.0, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "Haitian people that the international", "start": 190.48, "duration": 5.759}, {"text": "community must honor, not with pity, but", "start": 193.04, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "with purpose, not temporarily, but", "start": 196.239, "duration": 6.161}, {"text": "sustainably. And even as we respond to", "start": 199.12, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "the security crisis, humanitarian", "start": 202.4, "duration": 6.559}, {"text": "assistance must remain at the center of", "start": 205.68, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "our efforts.", "start": 208.959, "duration": 6.161}, {"text": "Mr. President Grenada remains deeply", "start": 211.599, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "concerned about the continuing hardship", "start": 215.12, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "endured by the Cuban people. Our", "start": 217.519, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "humanitarian conscience cannot be", "start": 220.56, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "indifferent to the circumstances of", "start": 222.879, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "ordinary households, particularly", "start": 225.04, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "children, the elderly and other", "start": 227.84, "duration": 5.679}, {"text": "vulnerable persons whose difficulty", "start": 230.4, "duration": 5.759}, {"text": "deepen with each passing day that the", "start": 233.519, "duration": 6.481}, {"text": "present impass remains unresolved.", "start": 236.159, "duration": 6.561}, {"text": "We call for constructive engagement that", "start": 240.0, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "places the well-being of the Cuban", "start": 242.72, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "people at its center and opens a path", "start": 244.72, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "toward meaningful relief, improve living", "start": 247.76, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "conditions, and renewed opportunities.", "start": 251.04, "duration": 7.039}, {"text": "This requires Cuba and the United States", "start": 255.12, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "of America to address the very difficult", "start": 258.079, "duration": 6.801}, {"text": "but not insurmountable challenges of", "start": 261.6, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "ending of sanctions, the removal of the", "start": 264.88, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "embargo and blockade against the Cuban", "start": 267.68, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "people and importantly the necessary", "start": 270.16, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "reforms required to ensure the continued", "start": 273.6, "duration": 6.159}, {"text": "well-being of the Cuban people. Some of", "start": 277.04, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "such reforms Grenada notes are already", "start": 279.759, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "being undertaken.", "start": 283.12, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "Mr. President, as we speak of", "start": 285.759, "duration": 5.921}, {"text": "transforming our multilateral system, we", "start": 288.479, "duration": 5.361}, {"text": "must also ensure that its leadership", "start": 291.68, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "reflects the diversity, experience, and", "start": 293.84, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "aspirations of the people it serves.", "start": 296.32, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "Grenada therefore proudly joins our", "start": 299.759, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "Caracum family in giving or unequivocal", "start": 302.08, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "support to the candidacy of Ambassador", "start": 305.52, "duration": 6.399}, {"text": "Carolyn Rodrigue Becket of Guyana for", "start": 308.4, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "the position of secretary general of the", "start": 311.919, "duration": 6.12}, {"text": "United Nations.", "start": 314.56, "duration": 3.479}, {"text": "Caraccom heads of government have", "start": 319.039, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "endorsed her as the region's candidate,", "start": 320.96, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "recognizing the experience and", "start": 324.08, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "leadership she brings to this important", "start": 326.0, "duration": 5.759}, {"text": "moment for global multilateralism.", "start": 328.24, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "Her distinguished service as Guyana's", "start": 331.759, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "foreign minister and permanent", "start": 334.32, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "representative to the United Nation has", "start": 335.919, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "demonstrated a deep commitment to", "start": 338.88, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "diplomacy, dialogue, and international", "start": 341.199, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "cooperation.", "start": 344.24, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "The Caribbean has long demonstrated that", "start": 346.0, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "size does not determine the strength of", "start": 348.8, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "our ideas, the quality of our leadership", "start": 351.28, "duration": 5.199}, {"text": "or the values of our contribution to the", "start": 354.0, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "international community. We believe", "start": 356.479, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "Ambassador Rodriguez Burkeette is", "start": 359.919, "duration": 5.361}, {"text": "eminently qualified to serve the entire", "start": 362.24, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "United Nations membership. Her election", "start": 365.28, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "would represent a historic milestone for", "start": 368.72, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "a Caribbean region and a powerful", "start": 371.84, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "affirmation that every region including", "start": 374.639, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "small island developing states can", "start": 377.44, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "contribute to leadership at the highest", "start": 379.919, "duration": 7.041}, {"text": "levels of our multilateral system.", "start": 382.4, "duration": 7.519}, {"text": "Mr. President, we meet at a time of", "start": 386.96, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "significant global transformation.", "start": 389.919, "duration": 6.081}, {"text": "The challenges before us are complex,", "start": 392.96, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "but they also present an opportunity to", "start": 396.0, "duration": 5.199}, {"text": "renew our commitment to cooperation and", "start": 398.4, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "create practical solutions that improve", "start": 401.199, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "the lives of our people. The theme of", "start": 403.84, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "this session, restoring trust, managing", "start": 407.039, "duration": 6.401}, {"text": "transformation, a united nations that", "start": 410.24, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "delivers for all, challenges us to move", "start": 413.44, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "beyond declaration towards delivery for", "start": 416.96, "duration": 6.239}, {"text": "Grenada. Removing trust means", "start": 420.16, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "demonstrating through our actions that", "start": 423.199, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "international cooperation produces", "start": 426.08, "duration": 5.679}, {"text": "results. It means listening to one", "start": 429.039, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "another. It means respecting the voices", "start": 431.759, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "of small states as much as those of", "start": 434.479, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "large ones. It means building genuine", "start": 437.199, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "partnership and it means ensuring that", "start": 440.0, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "every country has the opportunity to", "start": 442.479, "duration": 5.361}, {"text": "pursue its legitimate development", "start": 445.36, "duration": 4.239}, {"text": "aspirations.", "start": 447.84, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "Grenada approaches this general assembly", "start": 449.599, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "in a spirit of partnership, optimism,", "start": 452.24, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "and constructive engagement. We remain", "start": 455.039, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "firmly committed to the purposes and", "start": 458.319, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "principles of the charter of the United", "start": 460.8, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "Nations, international law, peaceful", "start": 463.36, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "dialogue, and the peaceful settlement of", "start": 466.4, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "dispute. In an increasingly", "start": 469.28, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "interconnected world, cooperation is not", "start": 472.08, "duration": 7.76}, {"text": "merely desirable. It is indispensable.", "start": 475.36, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "Mr. President,", "start": 479.84, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "the transformation we advocate", "start": 482.4, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "internationally must also take place at", "start": 484.879, "duration": 6.241}, {"text": "home. Grenada is advancing an ambitious", "start": 487.759, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "long-term road map towards our 75th", "start": 491.12, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "anniversary of independence.", "start": 493.919, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "Anchored in our national sustainable", "start": 496.96, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "development plan of 2020 to 2035,", "start": 499.12, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "vision 75 charts a transformational", "start": 502.96, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "course for our nation rooted in", "start": 505.68, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "sustainability, resilience, equity, and", "start": 508.4, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "opportunity. At the heart of vision 75", "start": 510.96, "duration": 6.639}, {"text": "are five strategic pillars. Education", "start": 514.479, "duration": 5.281}, {"text": "and skill training, healthcare,", "start": 517.599, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "agriculture and food security, the", "start": 519.76, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "environment and energy, and housing.", "start": 522.159, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "These are not simply sectors of", "start": 525.68, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "government policy. They are investment", "start": 527.839, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "in people. We are investing in health", "start": 530.56, "duration": 5.279}, {"text": "and wellness, education and skills, food", "start": 533.279, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "security, renewable energy, digital", "start": 535.839, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "innovation, and environmental", "start": 538.8, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "sustainability. We are creating greater", "start": 540.88, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "opportunities for our young people and", "start": 543.839, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "preparing them not simply for the jobs", "start": 546.24, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "that exist today, but for the industry", "start": 548.8, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "they will define tomorrow. For Grenada,", "start": 551.76, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "transformation must always be people", "start": 555.6, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "centered. It means building resilience", "start": 558.0, "duration": 5.839}, {"text": "while creating opportunities, expanding", "start": 560.88, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "our economy while protecting our", "start": 563.839, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "environment, and embracing technology", "start": 565.92, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "while safeguarding humanity.", "start": 569.04, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "Mr. President, as a small island", "start": 572.0, "duration": 5.839}, {"text": "developing state, Grenada understands", "start": 575.04, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "resilience.", "start": 577.839, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "But experience has also taught us that", "start": 580.08, "duration": 6.319}, {"text": "resilience cannot begin after disaster", "start": 583.279, "duration": 5.921}, {"text": "strikes. We must invest before the", "start": 586.399, "duration": 5.921}, {"text": "storm, prepare before the emergency", "start": 589.2, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "build, before the damage is done, and", "start": 592.32, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "finance resilience before countries are", "start": 594.88, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "forced to borrow simply to rebuild what", "start": 597.92, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "they have lost. This requires greater", "start": 600.64, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "international cooperation in climate", "start": 604.399, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "adaptation, disaster preparedness,", "start": 606.88, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "resilient infrastructure and accessible", "start": 609.839, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "financing.", "start": 612.88, "duration": 3.6}, {"text": "Small island developing states should", "start": 614.399, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "not be viewed simply as victims of", "start": 616.48, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "climate change. We are also laboratories", "start": 619.36, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "of resil of resilience.", "start": 622.72, "duration": 5.679}, {"text": "Climate action remains one of the areas", "start": 625.6, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "in which collective effort can make a", "start": 628.399, "duration": 5.281}, {"text": "profound difference. Grenada remains", "start": 630.8, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "committed to strengthening resilience", "start": 633.68, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "and advancing sustainable and lowcarbon", "start": 636.16, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "development. But ambition without", "start": 639.12, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "implementation is merely aspiration.", "start": 641.92, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "For vulnerable countries, climate", "start": 645.76, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "commitments must be accompanied by", "start": 648.399, "duration": 4.641}, {"text": "reliable access to the resources", "start": 651.04, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "required to deliver them. Climate", "start": 653.04, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "financing must become more accessible,", "start": 655.44, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "predictable, and responsive. Our", "start": 658.32, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "objective should not simply be to help", "start": 661.2, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "vulnerable countries recover from the", "start": 663.6, "duration": 5.679}, {"text": "next disaster. Our objective must be to", "start": 666.24, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "transform vulnerability into resilience", "start": 669.279, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "and resilience into sustainable", "start": 672.24, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "opportunity.", "start": 674.959, "duration": 4.241}, {"text": "Mr. President, this transformation must", "start": 676.64, "duration": 4.879}, {"text": "also take place in the international", "start": 679.2, "duration": 4.879}, {"text": "financial system.", "start": 681.519, "duration": 5.361}, {"text": "Grenada welcomes growing recognition", "start": 684.079, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "that development and vulnerability", "start": 686.88, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "cannot be accessed by income alone. The", "start": 689.12, "duration": 8.0}, {"text": "multi-dimensional vulnerability index", "start": 693.68, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "offers an important opportunity to", "start": 697.12, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "better recognize the structural", "start": 699.6, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "circumstances of small island developing", "start": 702.16, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "states. Our vulner our vulnerabilities", "start": 704.88, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "are shaped by exposure to climate", "start": 708.56, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "change, natural disasters, external", "start": 710.72, "duration": 6.239}, {"text": "economic shocks and other circumstances", "start": 714.079, "duration": 6.081}, {"text": "that cannot adequately be captured", "start": 716.959, "duration": 5.921}, {"text": "through income per capita.", "start": 720.16, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "Grenada therefore encourages member", "start": 722.88, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "states, development partners, and", "start": 725.12, "duration": 5.279}, {"text": "international financial institutions to", "start": 727.44, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "advance vulnerability inform approaches", "start": 730.399, "duration": 6.321}, {"text": "to development financing.", "start": 733.92, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "Greater access to concessional", "start": 736.72, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "financing, climate finance, disaster", "start": 739.279, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "risk financing, and innovative financial", "start": 742.639, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "instruments can help countries move from", "start": 745.839, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "vulnerability to resilience and from", "start": 748.639, "duration": 6.961}, {"text": "recovery to sustainable growth.", "start": 751.44, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "Mr. President,", "start": 755.6, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "at the center of all of this must be our", "start": 757.92, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "young people. Their creativity, energy,", "start": 760.32, "duration": 5.199}, {"text": "and ideas are among our greatest", "start": 763.279, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "national and global assets. Our", "start": 765.519, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "responsibility is to give them the", "start": 768.399, "duration": 4.721}, {"text": "education, skills, technology, and", "start": 770.56, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "opportunities necessary to shape the", "start": 773.12, "duration": 5.839}, {"text": "world they will inherit. Digital", "start": 775.92, "duration": 4.719}, {"text": "transformation and emerging", "start": 778.959, "duration": 4.721}, {"text": "technologies, particularly artificial", "start": 780.639, "duration": 5.121}, {"text": "intelligence, offer enormous", "start": 783.68, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "possibilities for education, healthcare,", "start": 785.76, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "agriculture, public administration, and", "start": 788.8, "duration": 7.599}, {"text": "economic development. But access must be", "start": 792.0, "duration": 7.279}, {"text": "equitable. The technologies shaping", "start": 796.399, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "humanity's future must not create", "start": 799.279, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "another divide between those countries", "start": 801.92, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "that can afford to innovate and those", "start": 804.079, "duration": 6.161}, {"text": "that cannot. And access alone will not", "start": 806.8, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "be enough. As artificial intelligence", "start": 810.24, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "become increasingly embedded in our", "start": 813.6, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "economies and societies, we must develop", "start": 815.76, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "credible AI governance frameworks that", "start": 819.2, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "encourage innovation while protecting", "start": 822.32, "duration": 6.319}, {"text": "people, privacy, security, democratic", "start": 825.36, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "values and public trust. Technology must", "start": 828.639, "duration": 7.041}, {"text": "remain a tool for human development, not", "start": 832.24, "duration": 7.279}, {"text": "a replacement for human responsibility.", "start": 835.68, "duration": 7.519}, {"text": "We must prepare young people not only to", "start": 839.519, "duration": 6.641}, {"text": "use new technologies but to question", "start": 843.199, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "them, govern them and deploy them", "start": 846.16, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "ethically.", "start": 849.199, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "Mr. President, Grenada approaches the", "start": 851.44, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "future with confidence. We recognize the", "start": 853.839, "duration": 6.641}, {"text": "challenges before us, but we also see", "start": 856.959, "duration": 7.521}, {"text": "enormous possibilities. Our vision 75", "start": 860.48, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "embodies our determination to build a", "start": 864.48, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "stronger, healthier, a more resilient", "start": 867.12, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "and more prosperous Grenada. Our", "start": 870.0, "duration": 4.639}, {"text": "commitment to the sustainable", "start": 872.88, "duration": 4.319}, {"text": "development goals reflect our belief in", "start": 874.639, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "shared global progress and our", "start": 877.199, "duration": 5.841}, {"text": "engagement in this United Nations", "start": 880.079, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "reflect our conviction that partnership", "start": 883.04, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "remains one of humanity's greatest", "start": 885.68, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "sources of strength. But partnership", "start": 888.24, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "must deliver. So let this assembly send", "start": 891.199, "duration": 6.801}, {"text": "a clear message. Let us restore hope in", "start": 894.72, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "Haiti. Let us protect children and", "start": 898.0, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "civilians wherever conflict threatens", "start": 900.48, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "their lives. Let us choose dialogue over", "start": 903.12, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "division. Let us allow cooperation with", "start": 906.079, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "Cuba and with all nations to be guided", "start": 908.8, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "by the interests and well-being of", "start": 911.68, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "people. Let us ensure that small island", "start": 913.839, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "developing states have fair access to", "start": 916.8, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "the financing necessary to build", "start": 919.44, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "resilience before disaster strikes. Let", "start": 921.92, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "us equip our young people to lead the", "start": 924.8, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "technological transformation rather than", "start": 927.68, "duration": 6.399}, {"text": "become casualties of it. Let us protect", "start": 930.56, "duration": 6.959}, {"text": "our oceans and our planet. And let us", "start": 934.079, "duration": 7.041}, {"text": "transform our multilateral institutions", "start": 937.519, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "so that they deliver not simply promises", "start": 941.12, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "but progress.", "start": 944.639, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "The measure of this United Nations", "start": 947.6, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "cannot only be the resolutions we adopt.", "start": 949.839, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "It must be the lives we improve, the", "start": 953.12, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "children we protect, the conflict we", "start": 955.839, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "help prevent, the opportunities we", "start": 958.72, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "create, and the hope we restore. Mr.", "start": 961.36, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "President, Grenada stands ready to work", "start": 965.12, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "with all member states and the", "start": 968.0, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "international partners in advancing a", "start": 970.0, "duration": 5.839}, {"text": "future that is peaceful, resilient,", "start": 972.88, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "inclusive, and sustainable.", "start": 975.839, "duration": 6.321}, {"text": "One year ago, Grenada came before this", "start": 978.56, "duration": 6.719}, {"text": "assembly with a message about resilience", "start": 982.16, "duration": 5.119}, {"text": "and education.", "start": 985.279, "duration": 5.441}, {"text": "Today, we build upon that message.", "start": 987.279, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "Resilience gives us the strength to", "start": 990.72, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "endure. Transformation gives us the", "start": 993.759, "duration": 5.681}, {"text": "power to change. Partnership gives us", "start": 996.639, "duration": 6.481}, {"text": "the ability to do both", "start": 999.44, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "together. Through renewed trust and", "start": 1003.12, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "genuine partnership, we can build a", "start": 1006.0, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "United Nation that delivers, a United", "start": 1009.04, "duration": 6.159}, {"text": "Nation that protects, a United Nations", "start": 1012.24, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "that listens, a United Nation that acts,", "start": 1015.199, "duration": 7.281}, {"text": "and ultimately a world in which no", "start": 1019.12, "duration": 7.919}, {"text": "country, no community, and no person is", "start": 1022.48, "duration": 8.079}, {"text": "left behind. May God bless the United", "start": 1027.039, "duration": 8.561}, {"text": "Nations. I thank you, Mr. President.", "start": 1030.559, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "I thank the chair of delegation of", "start": 1039.76, "duration": 5.72}, {"text": "Grenada.", "start": 1042.48, "duration": 3.0}]